{"page":231,"w":7029,"h":11508,"lines":[{"x":0.073484251723279395,"w":0.82451763400783795,"y":0.9406711158114337,"h":0.023221666850741007,"text":"to bear their cross. But if anyone really supposes that there","conf":1},{"text":"is a way to God which does not pass through the experience","y":0.91860465118679446,"conf":1,"w":0.82422801426478809,"x":0.071258920729838748,"h":0.021871539335402201},{"x":0.073634224540279514,"text":"of utter tranquillization and submergence of which Luther","conf":1,"y":0.89680232567907414,"w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.020360372369251589},{"conf":1,"x":0.073634219637202056,"w":0.82422801426478798,"h":0.020348836505223789,"text":"speaks, that there is any man whom God does not constantly","y":0.87500000038110903},{"w":0.82185269640637681,"text":"remind, through experience, that he is essentially nothing,","y":0.85168650818703451,"x":0.076009516464270011,"h":0.021860003471374512,"conf":1},{"y":0.82986111086141645,"text":"then we must answer: such a one is only cherishing illusions;","x":0.078384808223664101,"w":0.81947742808948865,"conf":1,"h":0.01909722222222221},{"h":0.023524876624818836,"text":"he entirely fails to see the realities of life; and even though","conf":1,"x":0.075841749362752633,"y":0.80535794262052862,"w":0.8198028663536171},{"w":0.82208534339805706,"conf":1,"text":"his own life may pass outwardly without storm and stress,","h":0.022274598242744581,"x":0.075904143671931559,"y":0.78335153038779803},{"text":"he is blind to what God is ever showing him if only he will","conf":1,"x":0.07600949765359305,"y":0.76162790715820916,"h":0.021854236012413319,"w":0.81947742808948854},{"x":0.073634206881621464,"w":0.81947742808948854,"h":0.020377675692240471,"conf":1,"text":"see it. Is there after all any life without disillusionment and","y":0.73834325398479006},{"x":0.073634228716843164,"conf":1,"y":0.71502976181130662,"text":"suffering? And can a so-called happy man, in whose life the","w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.021888842658391194},{"text":"measure of suffering is trifling, close his eyes to the suffering","w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020458424848223467,"conf":1,"y":0.69320436552648146,"x":0.07600951267734575},{"h":0.017609126984126977,"y":0.67435515834030624,"conf":1,"text":"of others? must he not also suffer under the afflictions which","w":0.81710211023107759,"x":0.076009509119276342},{"h":0.020394979015229242,"y":0.64825581419651601,"x":0.073634221697772034,"w":0.82422801426478809,"conf":1,"text":"strike down his fellow men? And does not death face us all,"},{"w":0.81947742808948865,"conf":1,"text":"casting its shadow before it? No, if anyone imagines that","h":0.021825396825396859,"y":0.62500000031470138,"x":0.078384807248095753},{"text":"there is a way to the living God which does not pass through","y":0.60317460311526294,"h":0.020371908233279279,"w":0.81947742808948865,"conf":1,"x":0.076009511311550107},{"conf":1,"text":"the heart of darkness, then without realizing it he is already","y":0.57986111140681196,"w":0.81947742808948876,"h":0.020429585661206895,"x":0.076009501602524093},{"conf":1,"x":0.07600951267734575,"y":0.55803571440986111,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020452657389262496,"text":"involved in the deepest darkness from which there is no"},{"h":0.018970329610128234,"conf":1,"w":0.81947742808948865,"text":"issue—unless it be that he comes to realize that he is treading","x":0.07363419732698992,"y":0.53633720970987131},{"y":0.51308139582542356,"w":0.28266032330401536,"h":0.018912652182200618,"text":"the way of darkness.","conf":1,"x":0.078384805545141947},{"h":0.02183116428435794,"w":0.78622327532087044,"y":0.48982558158286993,"text":"May it be that the language of Luther has become strange","x":0.109263649423888,"conf":1},{"text":"to us and difficult to understand? In that case, what he says","conf":1,"x":0.078384816428404239,"y":0.46651785749689756,"w":0.81710211023107748,"h":0.021854235066307903},{"x":0.078384794987085837,"conf":1,"w":0.81472684191418931,"text":"may be perhaps more intelligibly expressed for us in a poem","y":0.44469246067799917,"h":0.021877306794363394},{"x":0.078384807456505987,"y":0.42584325361581443,"conf":1,"w":0.20902611373306867,"text":"of Eichendorff:","h":0.016121031746031744},{"x":0.2351543920249845,"h":0.020354604910290397,"y":0.38516865055162386,"text":"\"What we see is ever changing,","conf":1,"w":0.43942993956726867},{"conf":1,"text":"Daylight sinks to sunset glow:","x":0.28741093580327576,"y":0.36185515829677672,"h":0.02041228328432354,"w":0.40855105511553874},{"w":0.43942993956726867,"conf":1,"x":0.25178147032919224,"y":0.33720930265644999,"h":0.024709302281576528,"text":"Anguish with desire is mingled,"},{"conf":1,"y":0.31820436551817577,"h":0.020458424848223467,"w":0.47980994682807432,"x":0.28741094450248816,"text":"Death o'ershadowing all we know."},{"text":"\"Furtive as a thief in darkness","x":0.2351544053484832,"y":0.28343023313020332,"w":0.41805222746613735,"h":0.01744185932098874,"conf":1},{"text":"Sorrow glides across our way.","w":0.40855105511553874,"y":0.25719246031199405,"conf":1,"h":0.020423818202245814,"x":0.28503563472251564},{"conf":1,"text":"Look thy last on all things lovely':","y":0.23536706320603162,"h":0.020446889930301193,"w":0.48456058254489648,"x":0.25178146240926197},{"conf":1,"x":0.2850356426165972,"w":0.46318287044376516,"y":0.21220930288110895,"h":0.020429585661207006,"text":"Let them go; thou canst not stay."},{"conf":1,"h":0.024213690606374683,"y":0.1735563750215785,"w":0.50424347914658585,"x":0.23480724868620387,"text":"\"What delight on earth were lett us,"},{"w":0.45605701595157772,"conf":1,"x":0.28503562133537513,"y":0.15550595194250438,"h":0.017459163590083038,"text":"How could man his tears restrain"},{"text":"Cursing life that gave him being,","conf":1,"w":0.45130642977627844,"y":0.12936046536868817,"x":0.25653206149462282,"h":0.021802325097341368},{"text":"Didst not Thou in heaven reign?","conf":1,"w":0.45368169809316661,"x":0.28741093615531688,"y":0.10755813955888749,"h":0.021906145981379854},{"y":0.081395349354767221,"conf":1,"text":"235","x":0.46555819626436407,"w":0.052256528433267169,"h":0.01744185932098874}]}